@startuml

title Inappropriate Content Report Email Notification Sequence Diagram

actor User

participant "Frontend (Website)" as FE
participant "Apache\n(HTTP Server)" as Apache

box "Laravel Application" #LightGreen
  participant "Middleware" as MW
  participant "UserReportController" as URC
  participant "Eloquent ORM" as ORM
  participant "Email Service" as EmailService
  participant "GenericMail Mailable" as GenericMail
end box

participant "Laravel Mail Queue" as Mailer
participant "Sendmail" as Sendmail
database "MariaDB Database" as DB

note right of User
It is assumed the User is
authenticated/authorized unless an exception occurs.
end note

note left of DB
This email notification only triggers
when report_reason equals
"Contenido inapropiado".
end note


== Submit Marketplace Report ==

User -> FE: Submit report for inappropriate marketplace content
activate User
activate FE
activate Apache
activate MW
activate URC
activate ORM
activate EmailService
activate GenericMail
activate Mailer
activate Sendmail
activate DB

FE -> Apache: POST /reports

alt Route exists
    Apache -> MW: Forward HTTP marketplace report request
else Route not found
    Apache --> FE: 404 Not Found
    FE --> User: Display "Report submission route not found" error
end

alt Valid + Authorized
    MW -> URC: Pass authenticated and authorized report request
else Validation/Auth error
    MW --> FE: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden / 422 Unprocessable Entity
    FE --> User: Display validation or authorization error
end

URC -> URC: Validate reported_user_id, post_id, report_reason, and description

alt Validation success
    URC -> URC: Verify reporter is not reporting themselves
else Validation failure
    URC --> FE: 422 Unprocessable Entity
    FE --> User: Display invalid report form input errors
end

alt Reporter is not reported user
    URC -> ORM: UserReport::create(user_id, reported_user_id, post_id, report_reason, description, status='pending')
    ORM -> DB: INSERT INTO user_reports (...)
else Reporter is reporting themselves
    URC --> FE: 403 Forbidden
    FE --> User: Display "No puedes reportarte a ti mismo"
end

alt Report insert success
    DB --> ORM: Insert successful
    ORM --> URC: Report persisted
else Report insert failure
    DB --> ORM: Insert failed / SQL exception
    ORM --> URC: Report persistence failed
    URC --> FE: 500 Internal Server Error
    FE --> User: Display system error while submitting report
end

URC -> ORM: report->load(reporter, reportedUser, post)
ORM -> DB: SELECT reporter, reported user, and post related to report

alt Report relationships loaded
    DB --> ORM: Reporter, reported user, and post records
    ORM --> URC: Report context retrieved
else Relationship load failure
    DB --> ORM: Query failed / SQL exception
    ORM --> URC: Report context retrieval failed
    URC --> FE: 500 Internal Server Error
    FE --> User: Display system error while preparing report notification
end


== Trigger Email for Inappropriate Content ==

alt report_reason is "Contenido inapropiado"
    URC -> ORM: User::whereIn(role, ['Administrador de Mercado','Super Administrador'])->where(status='Activo')->whereNotNull(email)->get()
    ORM -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE role IN (...) AND status = 'Activo' AND email IS NOT NULL

    alt Admin lookup success
        DB --> ORM: Active marketplace/super admin recipients
        ORM --> URC: Admin recipient collection
    else Admin lookup failure
        DB --> ORM: Query failed / SQL exception
        ORM --> URC: Admin recipient lookup failed
        URC --> FE: 500 Internal Server Error
        FE --> User: Display system error while notifying administrators
    end

    alt At least one admin recipient found
        loop For each active marketplace/super admin
            URC -> EmailService: send(admin.email, "Nuevo reporte de contenido inapropiado en MAIKINE", reportNotificationMessage)
            EmailService -> GenericMail: new GenericMail(subjectText, messageText)
            GenericMail --> EmailService: Mailable instance created
            EmailService -> Mailer: Mail::to(admin.email)->queue(GenericMail)

            alt Email queued successfully
                Mailer -> Sendmail: Deliver inappropriate content report notification
                Sendmail --> Mailer: Delivery accepted
                Mailer --> EmailService: Email queued/sent successfully
                EmailService --> URC: Admin notification completed
            else Email queue/send failure
                Mailer --> EmailService: Queue / mail transport failure
                EmailService --> URC: Admin notification failed
            end
        end
    else No active admin recipients found
        note right of URC: No notification email sent\nNo active admin emails available
    end

else report_reason is different
    note right of URC: Report is stored only\nNo inappropriate content email is sent
end

URC -> URC: logActivity('Crear reporte de usuario', report details)

URC --> FE: Return JSON { success: true }
FE --> User: Show report submission confirmation

@enduml